Length [text box] - Converter
Type the Length of the Converter into the text box.
Remarks
After you inserted it, Plant Simulation shows its length here. If the MU is conveyed straight through
along the direction of insertion, its length and the length of the MUs determine how many MUs it can
accommodate.
Note
If the Converter is to convey MUs perpendicular, it has to provide enough room for the Length and the
Width of the MU to completely fit on the Converter, when the booking point is located on the converting
point in the center of the Converter.
You can change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the Converter by clicking Show
Manipulators 
  on the Edit ribbon tab or by pressing M on the keyboard.
